{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"farm_field_t1","model_identifier":"farm_field_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# farm_field_t1\n\nFarm field tier 1: a stick fence round dug rows. Crops are separate props (G4) placed on the rows (each row 1 column = 16 u wide).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: dark earth furrows with clods and weeds between grass headland strips, bed edging boards and seed-tag stakes, a sturdier fence with stone corner markers, a gate with lantern posts, a cobble path and signpost, a scarecrow with a crow, a tool rack, water barrel and trough, hay bales, sacks and a wheelbarrow. Crops are still drawn by the game on the slot_row lines.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: dark earth furrows with clods and weeds between grass headland strips, bed edging boards and seed-tag stakes, a sturdier fence with stone corner markers, a gate with lantern posts, a cobble path and signpost, a scarecrow with a crow, a tool rack, water barrel and trough, hay bales, sacks and a wheelbarrow. Crops are still drawn by the game on the slot_row lines.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..65, y 0..47, z -67..65 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 509, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 126 x 44 x 126 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Notes\n\n- Rows run along X, 7 rows of 16 u on 8 x 8 columns; `slot_row_N` marks the centre line of each row (crop props sit there).\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -70)\n- `slot_row_1` at (0, 3, -48)\n- `slot_row_2` at (0, 3, -32)\n- `slot_row_3` at (0, 3, -16)\n- `slot_row_4` at (0, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_5` at (0, 3, 16)\n- `slot_row_6` at (0, 3, 32)\n- `slot_row_7` at (0, 3, 48)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"earth_row_bed#5a3f28","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56,-0.2,-56],"to":[56,1,56],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,295,112,296],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[112,295,224,296],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[224,295,336,296],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[336,295,448,296],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[32,0,144,112],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[144,0,256,112],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3f765a1f-8360-5d9d-8deb-1d236e2cd29d"},{"name":"earth_row0#6f4f32","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56,1,-53],"to":[56,3,-43],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,264,112,266],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[106,284,116,286],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[112,264,224,266],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[116,284,126,286],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[78,136,190,146],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[190,136,302,146],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e4531a05-0188-5a7a-90c7-127f9267094c"},{"name":"earth_row0_top#7d5b3a","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56,3,-51],"to":[56,4.5,-45],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[224,264,336,266],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[466,284,472,286],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[336,264,448,266],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[472,284,478,286],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[376,186,488,192],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,194,112,200],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f144c27d-dc48-5192-94a7-7cdc8e9d9e6d"},{"name":"earth_ro